 "intention": "Anchor the critical logistics for Wednesday by confirming the van booking with my sister immediately, bypassing the distractions of Rita and Larry.","detail": "Using the payphone in the Pittsburgh terminal, I dial my sister's number. When she answers, I keep my voice steady and professional, just like on the air. I confirm the time, the date, and the location. It is the only thing that matters for the couch move. Everything else—Rita, Larry, the Rialto—is noise. Once the line goes dead, I will step away from the phone and stand still, waiting for the world to reset or continue, knowing that the one thing I control is my presence at that van at 8 AM."}
